      en: ["Taiz was the capital of the Kingdom of Yemen from 1948 to 1962.", "The Al-Qahira Fortress was built in the 10th century on a 150-meter-high rock.", "Jebel Sabir (3,006m) is one of the highest mountains in Yemen.", "The Al-Ashrafiya Mosque dates from around 1285 AD.", "Taiz is known as a center of Yemeni coffee (Mocha coffee).", "The city traditionally has the highest level of education in the country."],
