      en: ["Bajil is home to one of the oldest and largest cement factories in Yemen.", "The city is located approximately 55 km east of Al Hudaydah port.", "It sits at the base of the Haraz Mountains on the edge of the Tihama plain.", "Bajil is a major transit point on the highway to Sana'a.", "The surrounding wadis are known for significant tobacco production.", "The local climate is tropical with high temperatures year-round."],
